msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A9D99D4E_35D3_4074_9B0A_7E5A3AC6A97B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fba659f0341c86c1ae184030b8cad67265241d962635f602501d971184b340c
#. default-sha256: 13328eb432216062b9cc10b151185f0378dbc29e8de94d88ea55c615bb01b62c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A9D99D4E_35D3_4074_9B0A_7E5A3AC6A97B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will send a package with any supplies you need once a month.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Food, "
"clothing... ⟪k:4⟫and, ⟪k:5⟫hmm, ⟪k:6⟫something to pass the time..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Enviarei um pacote com todos os suprimentos que você precisar uma vez por mês.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"Comida, roupas... ⟪k:4⟫e, ⟪k:5⟫hmm, ⟪k:6⟫algo para passar o tempo..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EB5FBF65_86D4_4B41_92C9_567FADCDC9CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 349a8ffff6d644aaf6240df58ef13afe7681e7df31381ee41fc97faa4b8f885f
#. default-sha256: b10d82a68a4d62c3150b0936b91ec0a6453ec8e4e51fd231ecb20cc3c4dfeb9e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EB5FBF65_86D4_4B41_92C9_567FADCDC9CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac54edfcf41dbcc39737cb4e5a645cabf21d1a9856cd5502f12af7a9e86a21c6
#. default-sha256: ad79c41f47a6a0e2507c0788c87f16718525629d454f7f07e2299ae02021871a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If there’s anything you want, Michel, just tell me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now, ⟪k:4⟫or you can have "
"a servant pass a message on to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se tem algo que queira, Michel, é só me dizer.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Agora, ⟪k:4⟫ou você pode pedir "
"a um servo que me passe uma mensagem."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef020b403b6d0ac44938efde0c89af2c402ed4af12b45e0406035240d3441435
#. default-sha256: e18aa59d999814a925d8594292cbbbd6f6e73cb9af29bb5960117b71e245305f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can’t think of— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Actually, ⟪k:4⟫wait, ⟪k:5⟫I ⟪k:6⟫can⟪k:7⟫ think of one "
"thing.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I would like a chess set..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não consigo pensar em— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Na verdade, ⟪k:4⟫espere, ⟪k:5⟫eu ⟪k:6⟫consegui⟪k:7⟫ "
"pensar em uma coisa.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Gostaria de um jogo de xadrez..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6269f38fac134ed657b0e16dbe676a78ca49653bd97826db50172bf65144a34
#. default-sha256: 7d4b620ecd86341e5040efbfa663b9e1e571bc44181ad6f9ba2e3b6751442d5f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right. I’ll have one made—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tudo bem. Vou mandar fazer um—"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 169f147839d1b96aa1f32d24e23959585e81d0167c8daa4b5d83ffaa1ef24fd4
#. default-sha256: 8f15c42d5bff93ba800b568c4bb145cc7cd33c076de288006fafedf8280399a5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would rather have... ⟪k:2⟫yours, Didier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Would that be possible...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu preferiria ter... ⟪k:2⟫o seu, Didier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Isso seria possível...?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49a539d6e07ee7bbd886dd11d7eeeb0724b9e6eda06429bada38997867460a92
#. default-sha256: c0197f5f44b7b432a7eef227db02a0ee557e65ffafda9f0c7be8761b9a4edd5d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you sure you want that beaten old thing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Você tem certeza de que quer aquela coisa velha e surrada?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd570f24a83891ffa85d934157e9ebdd656a38a889144f3cb36ce64eff3fb2e1
#. default-sha256: 16d549e010ca0e1adfd44afad642e04e84b633bb3f0efdce98456e3964195f83
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Yes, I want that one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫... Sim, eu quero ele."

#: scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02e45003d1a98fc07d086a53498b39a6b72c51e0b66229e8653538a3d376572c
#. default-sha256: 81c79e7c4e47442dc5f42eb2afb8c8e9c6399747ac790381286af03a7dc394dc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...All right, then. I’ll include it in the first delivery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Tudo bem, então. Vou incluir na primeira entrega."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c8ba820ed4a0018b8fc4177ff20d01263a9160b80c604664501d1924b1568b3
#. default-sha256: 9950040c03ba222dc8d951be40ee3278be9b7b997391a4f4a737e6cfeac3059d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll send you something too, Michel.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything you want, just tell me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eu te mandarei algo também, Michel.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Qualquer coisa que você quiser, "
"é só me dizer."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8505737b8926f12d6d102401b5861a43d111c16b00b4fb21e2f109a8b4b85692
#. default-sha256: e77b85c4aad38d97ff72593fb725784e194c6590d1c5b02130efa20abb964243
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In that case... ⟪k:5⟫I would like some art tools.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"I’m nowhere near as much of an artist as you are,⟪k:8⟫Georges, so they don’t have to be anything "
"special."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nesse caso... ⟪k:5⟫Eu gostaria de algumas ferramentas de "
"arte.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Não sou nem de longe um artista como você,⟪k:8⟫Georges, então não precisa ser nada "
"especial."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9f2dd145b73082ba7bb306aad95a76a6903349e853270bba7cd9ab20125b79d
#. default-sha256: f51e88606ad343afa9237aed1d9c966df9b1a8e84a5fa72f4d10489c3d437e3c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotcha. So some canvas and, ⟪k:2⟫hmm... ⟪k:3⟫how ’bout some charcoal?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And when "
"you’re back, I want to see what you’ve made with it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Entendi. Então, algumas telas e, ⟪k:2⟫hmm... ⟪k:3⟫que tal um pouco de carvão?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"E quando você voltar, quero ver o que fez com isso, tá bem?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1f3aa579b61187bf43da515d2ecd2e0635ee543a0291e3ab7c6deb8400da5e4
#. default-sha256: eaa543499e7c301f0e9075c72f1dea2cfdea6a2ff61aa9186f9331148d2dd43a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tá bem."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 864010231fcea1ce99a8a411543ec52f8cb0a4685b3b1b547d39e1a7be566b27
#. default-sha256: 39b56fa98db7c64fcaf3f1c4765f6bb62b5a6fc1e160d787d26e6b41fc39efc7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I know this is already hard enough on you, Michel...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but I need "
"to ask you to do something for me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Avoid making contact with anyone who doesn’t already "
"know about you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu sei que isso já é difícil o suficiente para você, Michel...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"mas preciso te pedir para fazer uma coisa por mim.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Evite fazer contato com qualquer um "
"que ainda não saiba sobre você."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3C6A4E98_1E6E_47E0_81AE_514B9EECE399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 320c6741d1d68c46b1c83742b61f81aac546402168b74dd5f260805d55a89aa6
#. default-sha256: 0ba4cb7545f6a6dda4cecb46eb1692d563f908ae8dcb50d2cb2f786a6f0f7c09
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3C6A4E98_1E6E_47E0_81AE_514B9EECE399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So... ⟪k:2⟫I can’t talk to anybody but the servants?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Então... ⟪k:2⟫Não posso falar com ninguém além dos servos?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0093026E_84C6_4E0C_B5AE_68C8DD4C7C2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c94dcbc543cc2fb187f0e3e082e11502e1b5af31a01436db6eb0974d74a1fb7c
